 change&quot;&#x27;</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">qmd query </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">$&#x27;hyde: The migration plan involves three phases. First, we add the new columns without dropping the old ones. Then we backfill data. Finally we cut over and remove legacy columns.&#x27;</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">qmd search </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;query&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--collection</span><span class=\"token plain\"> notes</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">qmd query </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;query&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--collection</span><span class=\"token plain\"> project-docs</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">qmd search </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;query&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" styl